[38;5;231m[49m⏺[39m Section 1 of the design — architecture, components, and data flow.

  [1mArchitecture.[0m One new file, [38;5;153midentity.js[39m, at the repo root next to [38;5;153mapp.js[39m, loaded by a script tag in [38;5;153mindex.html[39m [3mbefore[0m
  [38;5;153mapp.js[39m. It owns identity entirely; [38;5;153mapp.js[39m keeps owning form handling. I'll use plain top-level functions in global
  scope rather than ES modules, because [38;5;153mindex.html[39m loads [38;5;153mapp.js[39m with a bare [38;5;153m<script src>[39m and there's no bundler —
  switching to [38;5;153mtype="module"[39m would be a structural change this task doesn't need.

  [1mThe stored shape.[0m One [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m key, [38;5;153mwebapp.identity[39m, holding a versioned envelope:

